 .../java/com/example/demoplugin/Module.java   |  1 +
 .../demoplugin/MaintenanceStateTest.java      | 57 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 103 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/main/java/com/example/demoplugin/MaintenanceState.java
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/com/example/demoplugin/MaintenanceStateTest.java

